From c9d65c0d445ced675b8a6792e49f097f50f9f6dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 22:49:21 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] www: the Reaper page kit and one menu model

rp.js / rp.css: the component kit every native page uses (cards, tabs that
remember, toggles, tables with one sorter and one comparator, inputs with the
shared validators, apply bar, request helper with the http_id token, escape
helpers), loaded once and cached. menu.js: the one menu model the shell's rail
and tab strip read, with each tab's feature gate.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
